title: Modular code development type-along - CodeRefinery lesson
type: dataset
abstract: Making reusing parts of your code easier. The focus of this lesson is how
  to partition and organize projects as they grow from one screen-full to larger and
  how to make code portions reusable across projects and across notebooks.
